s\"><!-- HOST LIST VIEW UPDATE *** --><ul class=\"ot-host-opt\"><li class=\"ot-host-info\"><dl><div class=\"ot-c-name\"><dt>Name</dt><dd>__hssc</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-host\"><dt>Host</dt><dd>img.com</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-duration\"><dt>Duration</dt><dd>A few seconds</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-type\"><dt>Type</dt><dd>First Party</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-category\"><dt>Category</dt><dd>Analytics Cookies</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-description\"><dt>Description</dt><dd>This cookie name is associated with websites built on the HubSpot platform.  It is reported by them as being used for website analytics.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"ot-host-info\"><dl><div class=\"ot-c-name\"><dt>Name</dt><dd>_ga</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-host\"><dt>Host</dt><dd>img.com</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-duration\"><dt>Duration</dt><dd>729 Days</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-type\"><dt>Type</dt><dd>First Party</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-category\"><dt>Category</dt><dd>Analytics Cookies</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-description\"><dt>Description</dt><dd>This cookie name is associated with Google Universal Analytics - which is a significant update to Google's more commonly used analytics service. This cookie is used to distinguish unique users by assigning a randomly generated number as a client identifier. It is included in each page request in a site and used to calculate visitor, session and campaign data for the sites analytics reports.  By default it is set to expire after 2 years, although this is customisable by website owners.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"ot-host-info\"><dl><div class=\"ot-c-name\"><dt>Name</dt><dd>_clsk</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-host\"><dt>Host</dt><dd>img.com</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-duration\"><dt>Duration</dt><dd>A few seconds</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-type\"><dt>Type</dt><dd>First Party</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-category\"><dt>Category</dt><dd>Analytics Cookies</dd></div><div class=\"ot-c-description\"><dt>Description</dt><dd>Used by Micr